OL,3,GNEWSAFour men charged after teen rape
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men have been charged with
OL,7,Fmultiple sex offences after three
OL,8,Fteenage girls were allegedly raped.
OL,10,FWilliam Smith, 22, of Farnsby Street,
OL,11,Ffaces three counts of rape, drug
OL,12,Foffences and child sex offences, while
OL,13,FZak Hanman, 20, of Windsor Road, is
OL,14,Fcharged with two counts of sexual
OL,15,Fassault by penetration and false
OL,16,Fimprisonment.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
