OL,3,GNEWSAFour men charged after teen rape
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FLewis Wheeler, 26, of Berton Close,
OL,7,Ffaces two counts of rape, while Mason
OL,8,FTomkins, 20, of Walter Close, is
OL,9,Fcharged with sexual assault and sexual
OL,10,Factivity with a child. All men are from
OL,11,FSwindon.
OL,13,FIt comes after Wiltshire Police were
OL,14,Fcalled to reports of attacks on the
OL,15,Fteenage girls under 16 a property in
OL,16,FRatcoombe Road in Swindon on 31 May
OL,17,Flast year.
